      "id": "claim_a17c91c30c6947a792f6446f29a6a6d3",
      "statement": "grok-cli is a zero-dependency TypeScript/Node ESM CLI requiring Node >= 20, invoked through the bin name grok-research which package.json maps to dist/cli.js, built by `tsup src/cli.ts --format esm`; src/cli.ts is the only entrypoint and its top-level `await main()` handles every process launch.",
      "evidence": [
