      "id": "claim_9abc92bb644d42ee8f942c3ca54c76fe",
      "statement": "src/cli.ts main() drives the whole run: parseArgs, loadConfig, resolveCliOptions, canonicalizeMode, resolveWebOptions, validateWebOptions, assertWebToolsCompatible, the stderr web hint when search is enabled, then runMode with the single OpenRouter caller wired as (call) => callOpenRouter(config.openrouter, call), followed by stdout formatter dispatch; any thrown error goes to formatError on stderr with process.exitCode = 1, except HelpRequested which prints HELP_TEXT to stdout and exits 0.",
